{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有：X对人物为什么从上一种心态转到下一种心态的交代不如Y充分，尤其S05、S11和S13，部分心理转折需要观众自己补足。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的短句和放大关键词让观众能先抓住每段核心，即使来不及读完所有感受，也不容易错过主要转折；按音乐时点出现的细节，又让水波、呼吸、声线和心理变化形成具体而细腻的体验。Y把人物前后的因果关系讲得更清楚，整条故事线也更容易理解，但左侧长句需要连续阅读，右侧短词又较零散，边听音乐边扫时不容易把两者充分结合。综合实际观看体验，X更能兼顾抓重点、跟音乐和获得细腻感受，但叙事连贯性仍值得向Y借鉴。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d2276698-440d-4404-9de8-b379aadecf5e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T043724200257Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.671, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:38:02.886521+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "099bfe4c3ce5ad04fec160e066e13e7358d958f5f77a18a2d5603e960cc3d30e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7